# Design Handoff — Waitlist → Product Landing

This repo is the **design source of truth** until the product app exists.

## Generic process

Read `.cursor/templates/product-handoff.md` first — applies to all waitlist → product migrations.

## This project

1. Read **all files** in `.cursor/rules/product-landing-handoff/`
2. Reference this repo at tag `design-v1`
3. Copy **COPY AS-IS** files from `file-manifest.md`
4. **Adapt** marketing sections per `cta-migration.md` + `page-structure.md`
5. **Do not copy** waitlist modal, form, Web3Forms, or Resend integration

| Repo | Role |
|------|------|
| `leadgrab-waitlist` (this) | Waitlist validation — design reference |
| `leadgrab` (future) | Product app — receives borrowed UI |

Tag stable design: `git tag design-v1 && git push origin design-v1`
